<title>USA: AccuMed files patent protest.</title>
<headline>AccuMed files patent protest.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>AccuMed International Inc said Thursday it filed a protest with the U.S. Patent Office challenging a U.S. patent application by Neopath Inc for a method and apparatus for rapid capture of focused microscopic images.</p>
<p>AccuMed also said it was preparing a request for reexamination, which corresponds to the protest.</p>
<p>&quot;This protest is based, in part, on patents and technologies owned by AccuMed and which are used in several of the company's automated screening products,&quot; president Norman Pressman said in a statement.</p>
<p>AccuMed makes laboratory diagnostic products.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
